Allen Human Brain Atlas (ABA)

The brain transcriptomic data were obtained from the Allen Human Brain Atlas (ABA):

https://human.brain-map.org/static/download

The repository uses the complete normalized microarray datasets, which include gene expression values from six healthy adult human brains. These datasets contain normalized microarray expression values together with probe annotations and sample metadata required for downstream analyses, including probe-to-gene mapping and differential expression analysis.
